OrangeIslands_Sunburst_CrystalStation_Text_Researcher::
	.string "SUNBURST CRYSTAL STATION. We\n"
	.string "measure the hill.\p"
	.string "And the hill does not add up. The\n"
	.string "crystal runs in seams, and the\l"
	.string "seams all bend toward one room on\l"
	.string "the third floor.\p"
	.string "Something down there has been\n"
	.string "shaping them for a very long\l"
	.string "time.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_CrystalStation_Text_Assistant::
	.string "Steel and stone, if you want my\n"
	.string "guess. Nothing else scores\l"
	.string "crystal like that.\p"
	.string "He will not write that down\n"
	.string "without seeing it.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_CrystalStation_Text_Intern::
	.string "If you are going down anyway --\n"
	.string "GROUND types do well in there,\l"
	.string "and they do well against a lot\l"
	.string "of things out here.$"

